{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@objc","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AxeTeams","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Teams reach an event from one of two places, and the split matters:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Login","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", which is "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" stored here. "},{"code":"AxeClient","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" keeps the teams walnut returned"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for its own session on the client itself, beside "},{"code":"analyticsUserId","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"analyticsOrgName","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and hands them to "},{"code":"Amplitude","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"UsageServiceClient","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" when it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"constructs them. Keeping them per client is what stops two live "},{"code":"AxeDevTools","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instances (a host’s own session and "},{"code":"AutoScanManager","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"‘s, say) from stamping each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"other’s teams onto their events."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Injection","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", which is stored here, because it is genuinely process-wide: a host"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app calling "},{"code":"setTeams(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is asserting who is signed in "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"right now","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", not speaking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for one client. An injected value therefore overrides the login value on every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"client until a login supersedes it."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An injection outlives any one SDK session and is cleared only by the host replacing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it, because only the host knows when its own session changed. A login deliberately"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"does not clear it: with more than one live client (a host’s own session and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AutoScanManager"},{"type":"text","text":"‘s, say) one client’s login would otherwise wipe an injection that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"belongs to another. A host that logs out injects an empty array, which is honoured."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reads never throw and never block on a lookup: an unknown actor sends "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"teams: []"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rather than dropping an MAU-qualifying event over an optional dimension."}]}]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Type Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI\/documentation\/axeDevToolsXCUI\/AxeTeams\/setTeams(_:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Methods"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The host-injection channel for the actor’s team memberships, which are stamped onto","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every usage service and Amplitude event so MAU reporting can slice by team without a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"later join against billing-service (#3130).","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI\/documentation\/axeDevToolsXCUI"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axedevtoolsxcui\/axeteams"]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axedevtoolsxcui\/axeteams"]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"AxeTeams","symbolKind":"class","roleHeading":"Class","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AxeTeams","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"c:@M@axeDevToolsXCUI@objc(cs)AxeTeams","modules":[{"name":"axeDevToolsXCUI"}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AxeTeams","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI\/documentation\/axeDevToolsXCUI\/AxeTeams","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Inherits From","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI\/objc(cs)NSObject"],"kind":"relationships","type":"inheritsFrom"},{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI\/objc(pl)NSObject","doc:\/\/com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI\/s7CVarArgP","doc:\/\/com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI\/s28CustomDebugStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI\/SQ","doc:\/\/com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI\/SH"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo"}],"references":{"doc://com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI/objc(pl)NSObject":{"title":"ObjectiveC.NSObjectProtocol","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI\/objc(pl)NSObject"},"doc://com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI/SQ":{"title":"Swift.Equatable","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI\/SQ"},"doc://com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI/s23CustomStringConvertibleP":{"title":"Swift.Cu